version: 0.14.2
date-released: 2026-11-12
repository-code: https://github.com/kenwer/detectorist
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
abstract: >
  Detectorist is a multi-platform desktop application that finds, crops
  and identifies animals in large sets of photos, with models currently
  available for fish and Apoidea. Machine learning inference for
  detection, instance segmentation and species classification runs
  locally on the user's computer. Results are exported as standardized
  crops and CSV files.
keywords:
  - object detection
  - instance segmentation
  - species classification
  - image analysis
  - computer vision
  - machine learning
  - deep learning
  - local inference
  - biodiversity
  - fish
  - Apoidea
  - desktop application
